 "corrections": [
  "2026-10-01 correction: the miniz_oxide fallback is not free of unsafe in the gzip path. miniz_oxide 0.9.1 forbids unsafe, but flate2 computes gzip CRC-32 with crc32fast 1.5 (15 unsafe lines, SIMD intrinsics) and enables miniz_oxide's simd feature (simd-adler32 0.3.10, 36 unsafe lines, zlib-wrapped data only). Docs, CHANGELOG and the Cargo.toml comment now say the fallback narrows unsafe to that checksum code."
 ]
